  "title": "TCP: Contiguous ACK unseen segments are not wanted",
  "description": "In rare circumstances, a pure ACK will be followed by a series of\nTCP ACK unseen segments in the opposition direction. Only the first\npacket of this series should be marked as such. Closes #11624",
